{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "兰华", "steam": "蘭華"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "蘭華"}, "voice": {"chs": "rk0050", "steam": "rk0050", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "『——不过，从下周开始暂时就不开全校集会了。\\n　问理由就太不懂事了所以别问』", "steam": "『──不過，下週開始暫時沒有全校集會了喔。理由很不識趣所以大家不要問。』"}, "length": {"chs": 39, "steam": 36}, "similarity": 0.4}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "但这个惯例，似乎也只持续到今天。", "steam": "雖然是慣例，但暫時就到今天為止的樣子。"}, "length": {"chs": 16, "steam": 19}, "similarity": 0.323}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "讲台上的校长用手压住了台下疑惑的声音，\\n无奈地耸了耸肩。", "steam": "台上的學園長伸手示意大家安靜，然後聳了聳肩。"}, "length": {"chs": 29, "steam": 22}, "similarity": 0.255}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "然后就这样慢慢环视了我们一圈。", "steam": "她沉默地環視台下的學生們。"}, "length": {"chs": 15, "steam": 13}, "similarity": 0.0}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "她平时总是在煽动学生，\\n但是今天……感觉没那个兴致？", "steam": "平時總是煽動學生情緒的學園長，今天……好像有點不一樣？"}, "length": {"chs": 27, "steam": 27}, "similarity": 0.261}
